5) The claimant prays for an award for the following reliefs to the claimant.
(A) Pass an award directing the respondent to pay an amount of .2,40,41,996/- to the appropriate authority as sought vide notice/summons dated 15.11.2018 issued by the Court of Authority under Minimum Wages Act, 1948 and Regional Labor Commissioner (C), Raipur;
(B) Pass an award directing the respondent to pay an amount of .50,77,062/-to the claimant towards increased rates due to unprecedented increase in variables during the execution of the MARC and towards damages and penalty of EPF on arrear salary as incurred by the claimant;
(C) Pass an award directing the respondent to pay an amount of .10,00,000/- to the claimant on account of the expenses incurred/to be incurred by the claimant in the present arbitration proceedings; (D) Pass an award towards interest at 18% p.a. on each and every claim as enlisted above from the date /19/ Com.A.P.No.5/2021 of accrual till its realisation;
